{"id":6610021055,"name":"Noob Army Tycoon ⚔️(New noobs)","desc":"Welcome to Noob Army Tycoon ⚔️\n\nDevelop your tycoon, research new noobs and vehicles, send your troops to the front to control the map\nUnlock troops from WW1 to the futuristic era, up to 268 troops, to create the ultimate noob army🏆\n\nNew update :\n- Added 50 noobs 👥\n- Added 47 vehicles 🚗\n- New quests and added troops quests 📜\n- Added more building skins 🎨\n- Added mechs 🤖\n- and more to see in game 🎮\n\nHow to play :\n- Unlock workers and researchers to get new troops 🧪\n- Send your troops 🎯\n- Capture and defend points to earn more income 📈\n- Battle against players or form an alliance ⚔️\n\nPrevious update :\n- Added defense system 🪖\n- Added quests📜\n- Added gears 💥\n\nPremium users can unlock a free noob worker and a free noob researcher\nPrivate servers are free","path":"/game/6610021055-noob-army-tycoon","slug":"6610021055-noob-army-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8065b012da66b1c46a4e5ea41762ffbc2e3a6eca606d902c3a7c6d6f8f055dcb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-aa17dedce250248460be83ae35d7ff10/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":553,"visitor":414962692,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-14T03:17:44.868Z","creator":{"name":"Thinking Project","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Noob-Army-Tycoon-(New-noobs)-auto-farm-201202","_id":"69ddb1d828f45ab068f570c8","title":"auto farm open source keyless","game":{"_id":"68dfe5bb2d2cab8e37340d5e","gameId":6610021055,"name":"Noob Army Tycoon ⚔️(New noobs)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":6610021055},"features":"auto farm\nI just added a stop button","tags":["free"],"script":"-- made by @kylosilly on discord [dm/add me if any issues]\n-- [Upgraded with Rayfield UI & Stop/Resume Feature by Agent]\n\nlocal character = game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer.Character\nlocal map = game:GetService(\"Workspace\").Map\nlocal treasures = map.Treasures\nlocal obby_land = map.ObbyLand\n\ngetgenv().settings = {\n    -- main setting\n    auto_farm = false, -- Default aku matikan agar tidak langsung jalan sebelum UI dipencet\n    -- misc setting\n    farm_treasures = true \n}\n\nfunction get_time()\n    return os.date(\"%X\")\nend\n\n-- =======================================================\n-- 📱 MOD MENU (UI RAYFIELD)\n-- =======================================================\nlocal success, Rayfield = pcall(function()\n    return loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://sirius.menu/rayfield'))()\nend)\n\nif success then\n    local Window = Rayfield:CreateWindow({\n       Name = \"🏆 Auto Farm Hub\",\n       LoadingTitle = \"Memuat Script Upgrade...\",\n       LoadingSubtitle = \"by Agent & kylosilly\",\n       ConfigurationSaving = { Enabled = false },\n       KeySystem = false\n    })\n\n    local Tab = Window:CreateTab(\"Main Farm\", 4483362458)\n\n    Tab:CreateToggle({\n       Name = \"🚀 Aktifkan Auto Farm (Lanjut/Berhenti)\",\n       CurrentValue = false,\n       Flag = \"AutoFarmToggle\",\n       Callback = function(Value)\n           getgenv().settings.auto_farm = Value\n       end,\n    })\n\n    Tab:CreateToggle({\n       Name = \"💎 Auto Collect Treasures\",\n       CurrentValue = true,\n       Flag = \"TreasureToggle\",\n       Callback = function(Value)\n           getgenv().settings.farm_treasures = Value\n       end,\n    })\nend\n\n-- =======================================================\n-- ⚙️ BASE SCRIPT (Dipertahankan, hanya diubah sistem loop-nya)\n-- =======================================================\ntask.spawn(function()\n    while true do\n        task.wait(0.5) -- Jeda aman agar game tidak freeze saat toggle dimatikan\n        \n        if getgenv().settings.auto_farm then\n            local teleporters = obby_land.Teleporters\n            local finish = obby_land.Finish\n            \n            if (#teleporters:GetChildren() == 0) or (#finish:GetChildren() == 0) then\n                pcall(function() rconsoleprint(\"[Auto Farm] Teleporter or finish folder is empty. Attempting to fix. \"..get_time()..\"\\n\") end)\n                character:SetPrimaryPartCFrame(CFrame.new(obby_land.Model:GetPivot().Position))\n                pcall(function() rconsoleprint(\"[Auto Farm] Empty folders fixed. \"..get_time()..\"\\n\") end)\n                task.wait(2)\n            end\n            \n            local final_obby_teleporter = teleporters:FindFirstChild(\"11\")\n            local final_obby_finish = finish:FindFirstChild(\"11\")\n            \n            if final_obby_teleporter and final_obby_finish then\n                character:SetPrimaryPartCFrame(CFrame.new(final_obby_teleporter.Position))\n                pcall(function() rconsoleprint(\"[Auto Farm] Starting last obby. \"..get_time()..\"\\n\") end)\n                task.wait(.5)\n                fireproximityprompt(final_obby_teleporter.ProximityPrompt)\n                task.wait(5)\n                \n                character:SetPrimaryPartCFrame(CFrame.new(final_obby_finish.Position))\n                pcall(function() rconsoleprint(\"[Auto Farm] Teleported to the end. \"..get_time()..\"\\n\") end)\n                task.wait(.5)\n                fireproximityprompt(final_obby_finish.ProximityPrompt)\n                pcall(function() rconsoleprint(\"[Auto Farm] Claimed 20k. \"..get_time()..\"\\n\") end)\n                task.wait(.5)\n            end\n            \n            -- Perbaikan: Menambahkan pengecekan toggle farm_treasures yang lupa dimasukkan author asli\n            if getgenv().settings.farm_treasures then\n                if (#treasures:GetChildren() < 3) then\n                    continue\n                end\n                pcall(function() rconsoleprint(\"[Auto Farm] Collecting treasures. \"..get_time()..\"\\n\") end)\n                for _, v in pairs(treasures:GetChildren()) do\n                    local prompt = v:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"ProximityPrompt\")\n                    if (not prompt) then\n                        continue\n                    end\n                    character:SetPrimaryPartCFrame(CFrame.new(v.Position + Vector3.new(0, 20, 0)))\n                    task.wait(.5)\n                    fireproximityprompt(prompt)\n                end\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend)\n","owner":{"_id":"698f26cc67d0457f7d8d144c","username":"Lipi_","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bccf4004a3d3008a44769d0e95cf29d6e6b061dcb6428360c83adec059958fa5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/698f26cc67d0457f7d8d144c-1776136937413.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"698f26cc67d0457f7d8d144c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bccf4004a3d3008a44769d0e95cf29d6e6b061dcb6428360c83adec059958fa5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/698f26cc67d0457f7d8d144c-1776136937413.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":3165,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/96fd217f6391ad11ebf80ddcaa792cc859eef6e2f356125853a55df08dcf170c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/6610021055-1776136664852.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/6610021055-1776136664852.jpg"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-04-14T03:17:44.876Z","keyLink":"","executes":2001,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-18T02:04:15.633Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/96fd217f6391ad11ebf80ddcaa792cc859eef6e2f356125853a55df08dcf170c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/6610021055-1776136664852.jpg